 "children": [
  {
   "id": "note-library",
   "type": "note",
   "x": -440,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 400,
   "fontSize": 14,
   "content": "Heartbeat design library. Variables mirror design-system/tokens (source of truth: Kotlin).\nThemes: mode light|dark x host desktop|mobile = HbColors/HbSurfaceColors.forHost presets.\nImport: \"imports\": {\"hb\": \"<relative path>/heartbeat.lib.pen\"}; ref \"hb:<id>\", variables \"$hb:<name>\", theme {\"hb:mode\": \"dark\"}."
  },
  {
   "id": "section-components",
   "type": "frame",
   "name": "Components",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 560,
   "layout": "vertical",
   "gap": 24,
   "padding": 40,
   "fill": "$surfaces.backdrop",
   "theme": {
    "mode": "light",
    "host": "desktop"
   },
   "children": [
    {
     "id": "hb-button-primary",
     "type": "frame",
     "name": "HbButton / Primary / Regular",
     "reusable": true,
     "height": 32,
     "padding": [
      0,
      12
     ],
